1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,510
You ask an AI a question.

2
00:00:02,510 --> 00:00:04,580
Seconds later, an answer.

3
00:00:04,580 --> 00:00:05,564
But it isn't pulling

4
00:00:05,564 --> 00:00:07,660
a finished reply from a file.

5
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:08,786
It's predicting one,

6
00:00:08,786 --> 00:00:10,230
piece by piece.

7
00:00:10,230 --> 00:00:12,100
Here's what actually happens.

8
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:13,561
With popular AI chat apps,

9
00:00:13,561 --> 00:00:14,684
your message travels

10
00:00:14,684 --> 00:00:16,780
to computers in a data center,

11
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:18,950
running a large language model.

12
00:00:18,950 --> 00:00:21,600
First, your text is
split into tokens:

13
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:22,523
small chunks like words,

14
00:00:22,523 --> 00:00:23,680
parts of words,

15
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:26,240
or punctuation.

16
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:26,986
During training,

17
00:00:26,986 --> 00:00:28,198
the model learned patterns

18
00:00:28,198 --> 00:00:29,910
from huge amounts of text.

19
00:00:29,910 --> 00:00:30,896
It doesn't look through

20
00:00:30,896 --> 00:00:32,600
that text when it answers.

21
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:33,855
The patterns are captured

22
00:00:33,855 --> 00:00:35,540
in billions of numbers.

23
00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:36,894
Now it uses those patterns,

24
00:00:36,894 --> 00:00:39,010
and everything in
the conversation,

25
00:00:39,010 --> 00:00:40,246
to calculate which token

26
00:00:40,246 --> 00:00:42,040
is likely to come next.

27
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:43,040
It picks one,

28
00:00:43,040 --> 00:00:44,640
adds it, and repeats,

29
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:45,940
token by token,

30
00:00:45,940 --> 00:00:47,870
until the answer is complete.

31
00:00:47,870 --> 00:00:50,190
That's why AI sounds so fluent.

32
00:00:50,190 --> 00:00:52,600
But fluent isn't
the same as correct.

33
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:53,727
It can sound confident

34
00:00:53,727 --> 00:00:55,260
and still be wrong.

35
00:00:55,260 --> 00:00:58,120
So when an answer
appears in seconds,

36
00:00:58,120 --> 00:01:00,660
remember: it was built
one prediction at a time.

37
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:01,560
Check what matters.
